   "notes": "Described the base Mixtral 8x7B, the paper's single configuration; the Instruct model has the same architecture. The paper defers all non-MoE details to Mistral 7B ('same modifications as described in jiang2023mistral') without restating them. Norm type, norm placement, positional encoding (RoPE and theta), biases, tied embeddings and the attention scale are therefore not_stated. I did not infer them via inheritance because this source does not give their values. As a result, block_ops omits the norm and positional nodes and is incomplete until those values are sourced elsewhere. Residual adds are shown structurally but the residual flavour is not_stated. Mistral 7B's sliding-window attention is explicitly replaced by fully dense 32k attention, so window = 0 and window_size is not_stated. The q/k/v projection widths are derived from heads × head_dim (32×128, 8×128). The 'top-k softmax' gate is renormalised over the selected logits, so gate_norm = renorm."
  },
